    "387": {
      "date": "2026-10-16",
      "edition": "Friday 16 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Thibaud Flament facing weeks out with shoulder injury, weakening France's second row",
          "body": "Toulouse lock Thibaud Flament is facing several weeks on the sidelines with a shoulder injury, according to L'Équipe, a fresh blow for France coach Fabien Galthié as he readies his pack for the Springboks in Paris. Flament, 29, played the full 80 minutes of Toulouse's 45-34 Top 14 win over Bayonne on Sunday, and had been tipped to partner France's second row against Fiji, the Springboks and Argentina. Emmanuel Meafou is already expected to be without him too, as he recovers from a knee injury."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Argentina add Shaun Edwards and Mario Ledesma to coaching staff",
