          "heading": "Italy average 17.3 points a game scored over their last 11 matches",
          "body": "Over their last 11 matches, Italy have scored 190 points in total, an average of 17.3 a game. The bill has been heavier at the other end: across the same 11 games they have conceded 318, or 28.9 a game. Their biggest win in that stretch was a 34-19 home victory over Chile in November 2025, in an International Friendlies fixture."
