          "heading": "Scotland have won three and lost two of their last five games",
          "body": "In their last five games, Scotland have won three and lost two, with results alternating W L W L W from most recent to oldest. The latest of those was a 33-17 win over Fiji, played away in July's Nations Championship group stage. Three wins and two defeats from five makes for a steady rather than streaking record."
