          "heading": "Verdicts expected in Paris trial over killing of Argentina player Aramburú",
          "body": "Verdicts are expected in the trial in Paris over the killing of Argentina rugby player Aramburú. Today's coverage gives no date for the verdicts, and the outcome is not yet reported. The Pumas' next match is Ireland in Round 4 of the Nations Championship, with Italy and France also on the November list. Shaun Edwards and Mario Ledesma, the new coaching additions, start work with the Pumas at the end of October."
